ractice Sections: Pick any part of a song with markers on the timeline and loop it, with optional health like in a real run. [/*][*] New Practice Menu: A cleaner side panel, a slim pause bar and shortcut hints. Practice now starts instantly and uses your speed modifier. [/*] Levels & Ratings [*] Rate Levels: Rate a level with one click on the result screen and see every level's rating in the list. [/*][*] New Level Info: Cover, stats, rating, downloads and all maps at a glance","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-26T10:20:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114044388","verified_at":"2026-10-26T11:43:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4146650-1846018067928650","game_id":"steam-4146650","kind":"update","title":"0.3.0 Update: All-New Visuals, Replays, a Timing Editor & osu! Import","summary":"All-New VisualsReworked Gameplay Visuals: New particles and VFX, a music-reactive background, and a new HUD that sits neatly around the keyboard.Fresh UI Look: A new design with a yellow accent color and sharper text everywhere.Replays & ScoresWatch Replays: Watch any leaderboard score as a replay.Score Details & Profiles: View score details, and other players' profiles.Editor UpgradesNew Timing Tab: Tempo changes, automatic BPM detection, a metronome, and a zoomable waveform with beat snapping.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T07:34:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067928650","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4146650-1839041357024948","game_id":"steam-4146650","kind":"update","title":"0.2.0 Major Update: Community Level Browser, Leaderboards & Much More","summary":"User Profiles, Leaderboards & RankingsNew Player Profiles: Track your overall progression with dedicated stats, including total score, ranked score, and accuracy.Leveling & XP System: Earn XP by playing maps and level up your profile over time.Custom Map Leaderboards: Leaderboards are no longer restricted to official levels. Custom community levels now have full leaderboard support!Infinite Scroll Leaderboards: Removed the strict 10-score limit. Leaderboards now dynamically load more scores as y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-22T20:03:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357024948","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4146650-1827626365771564","game_id":"steam-4146650","kind":"announcement","title":"0.1.2 Map layouts & more","summary":"Added a variety of new map/key layoutsAdded automatic difficulty settings optionChanged map speed and song position shortcuts in practice mode to \"shift + arrow key\"Bugfix: Update map difficulty when changing map settingsBugfix: In editor always select newly added mapsBugfix: Show correct rank of best score on overworld map-list-itemBugfix: Editor preview videoBugfix: Change offset when pasting notesBugfix: Duplicate notes when recordingSmall improvements","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-26T19:15:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365771564","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4146650-1826992588592252","game_id":"steam-4146650","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank you for 2.000 wishlists!","summary":"2000 wishlists already?!Thanks to ALL of you for wishlisting the game, playing the demo, and giving me feedback over on Discord! 💜I'm working super hard on getting out the next updates with custom key layouts / game modes and I'm looking forward to seeing how you will be using these new tools. 😄I'm also working on a MUPO server that will handle level publishing, replays and much more, so stay tuned. 🙂If you haven't already go wishlist MUPO now","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-12T12:26:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588592252","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4146650-1825093633188757","game_id":"steam-4146650","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix 0.1.1.2","summary":"Fix file browser integration on macOS silicon devices","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-20T18:38:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825093633188757","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4146650-1825093633187704","game_id":"steam-4146650","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix 0.1.1.1","summary":"Fix system language identification. This would previously cause the game not to start.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-20T12:44:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825093633187704","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4146650-1825093633184614","game_id":"steam-4146650","kind":"announcement","title":"0.1.1 Credits & small bug fixes","summary":"Add creditsShow version number on title screenFix steam discussion linkFix map duplication bug (score colors weren't being copied)Fix map name auto sizingFix undo and redo shortcutsAdd shortcut tooltips to undo, redo, copy, paste and cut buttonsThank you to everyone playing, giving feedback and finding bugs. 💜","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-19T11:15:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825093633184614","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4146650-1824644522843496","game_id":"steam-4146650","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev-Log: Demo Release & Feedback","summary":"These last few weeks were pretty stressful but also exciting.The playable demo is finally out on Steam. I've added a new tutorial level, in-game accuracy display, visual health bar, leaderboard friends tab, audio latency setting, and a Discord rich presence integration. I've also made sure that your global scores will carry over when I change the leaderboards from Steam to a custom Supabase server in the future.It's my first time releasing something on Steam and I'm really thankful for everyone ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-15T13:54:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1824644522843496","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4146650-1823825466500631","game_id":"steam-4146650","kind":"announcement","title":"MUPO Demo – Coming Soon","summary":"The MUPO demo is almost ready and currently going through Steam verification.This demo is a first playable version of the game, a chance to test the core mechanics and help shape the final release through feedback and bug reports.What’s in the demo:Fast paced rhythm gameplay6 official songs with different difficulty levelsA tutorial level to get you familiar with the mechanicsModifiers to customize the challengeA built in level editor to create your own maps (editor is still in beta)Online leade","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-06T20:07:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1823825466500631","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4146650-1823191198605471","game_id":"steam-4146650","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev-Log: Editor & Tooling","summary":"Quick dev update: I’ve been polishing the level editor with better tool separation, stability improvements, and cleaner selection/movement behavior.Full breakdown in the Patreon devlogs:Dev-Log: Editor & Tooling Part 1Dev-Log: Editor & Tooling Part 2","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-30T14:39:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1823191198605471","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4146650-1819386365116000","game_id":"steam-4146650","kind":"announcement","title":"Why THIS Game Took Me 5 Years to Make","summary":"I've been working on this game for a long time now. In this video, I talk about how it all came together and what inspired the project. I would love to hear some feedback about what you think of the concept and some first impressions.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-31T13:09:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1819386365116000","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4146650":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:43:20Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:43:19Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4146650":"2026-10-26T11:43:20Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4146650":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:43:19Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:43:19Z","stat